 | `--color-surface` / `-hover` / `-active` | `surface0` / `surface1` / `surface2` | Cards, rows, controls |
-| `--color-text` / `-muted` / `-subtle` / `-disabled` | `text` / `subtext1` / `subtext0` / `overlay1` | Text, by descending emphasis |
